{% set name = entry.name %}
Loupe's sidebar link. {{ entry.summary }}

```jsx
<{{ name }} label="Board" icon={<BoardIcon />} active />
<{{ name }} label="Documents" icon={<FileIcon />} count={12} />
```

Put the links inside the sidebar, which gives them the dark chrome background. Pass `active` on the link of the current page. The component sets `aria-current="page"` itself. Pass an svg that uses `currentColor` as the icon. The component emits the real `{{ entry.rootClass }}` classes of the app.
